<title>HONG KONG: HK Stock Exchange re-elects Edgar Cheng chairman.</title>
<headline>HK Stock Exchange re-elects Edgar Cheng chairman.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Council of the Stock Exchange of Hong Kong on Monday re-elected Edgar Cheng chairman for 1996, the exchange said in a statement.</p>
<p>Cheng has been chairman since 1994.</p>
<p>Dennis Lam was elected first Vice-Chairman and Fung Chi-kin second Vice-Chairman.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590</p>
</text>
